<h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-4 mb-0">
  Your admin API <%= "key".pluralize(@keys.size) %> will be revoked
</h1>
<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-0">
  Hi <%= h(@user.display_name) %>, Hackatime admin API keys now have scopes, so each key only gets access to the endpoints it needs.
  Your existing <%= "key".pluralize(@keys.size) %> still <%= @keys.size == 1 ? "has" : "have" %> every scope for now, but will be revoked automatically:
</p>
<ul class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-0">
  <% @keys.each do |key| %>
    <li><strong><%= key[:name] %></strong> (<code><%= key[:token_preview] %>...</code>) on <%= key[:expires_at] %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-0">
  Before then, create a new key with only the scopes you need and switch your tools over to it.
</p>

<%= render "shared/mailer/button", url: @new_key_url, label: "Create a scoped key" %>
